<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>Omen_of_Doomsday</defName>
    <label>Omen of Doomsday</label>
    <description>High-power mechanoid signal emitter vastly exceeding standard beacon capacity. Activation releases a catastrophic pulse summoning the titan-class Doxa-0 with its escort forces. Victory yields rare tech components from the wreckage. The pulse overload destroys the emitter after single use.</description>
    <graphicData>
